Body:

These are taken from the [Integrative Values Charter](https://integrativevalues.org) (IVC). 

The IVC was developed through the Institute of Applied Metatheory's Integrative Commons initiative — a collaborative effort to create open, non-proprietary infrastructure for the integrative values emerging in the 21st century.
